{"id":"6d8f8949329afbbc","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-ep-properties.md","title":"EP 对的基本性质","display":"thm-embedding-projection-properties — EP 对的基本性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-ep-properties","aliases":["16-thm-ep-properties","16-thm--ep-properties"],"display":"thm-embedding-projection-properties — EP 对的基本性质","depends_on":["[[16-df-embedding-projection]]"],"source":"Elementary consequences of EP equations in §10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658); proof in note","revision_date":"2026-10-15","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-ep-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-ep-properties</span><span>16-thm--ep-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-embedding-projection-properties — EP 对的基本性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" href=\"?note=ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" title=\"16-df-embedding-projection\">16-df-embedding-projection</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Elementary consequences of EP equations in §10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658); proof in note"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E\">\\(D,E\\)</span> 为小 dcpo，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" href=\"?note=ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" title=\"16-df-embedding-projection\">16-df-embedding-projection</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall x,x&#39;\\in D)\\bigl(e(x)\\leq_Ee(x&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow x\\leq_Dx&#39;\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\forall y\\in D)(\\exists z\\in E)\\ p(z)=y,\\\\\ne[D]=\\{z\\in E\\mid e(p(z))=z\\},\\qquad\n(e\\circ p)\\circ(e\\circ p)=e\\circ p.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall x,x&#39;\\in D)\\bigl(e(x)\\leq_Ee(x&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow x\\leq_Dx&#39;\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\forall y\\in D)(\\exists z\\in E)\\ p(z)=y,\\\\\ne[D]=\\{z\\in E\\mid e(p(z))=z\\},\\qquad\n(e\\circ p)\\circ(e\\circ p)=e\\circ p.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：单调性给出正向保持，逆向应用单调的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 并用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pe=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(pe=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 有原像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(y)\">\\(e(y)\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=e(x)\">\\(z=e(x)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ep(z)=epe(x)=e(x)\">\\(ep(z)=epe(x)=e(x)\\)</span>；反之固定点显然在像中。幂等式同样由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pe=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(pe=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span> 得到。这些结论不需要带底假设；像刻画本身也不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ep\\leq\\operatorname{id}\">\\(ep\\leq\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-embedding-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-embedding-projection]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-embedding-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,E$ 为小 dcpo，$\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p)$ 见 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall x,x'\\in D)\\bigl(e(x)\\leq_Ee(x')\\Longleftrightarrow x\\leq_Dx'\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\forall y\\in D)(\\exists z\\in E)\\ p(z)=y,\\\\\ne[D]=\\{z\\in E\\mid e(p(z))=z\\},\\qquad\n(e\\circ p)\\circ(e\\circ p)=e\\circ p.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"pe=\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"e(y)","display":false},{"tex":"z=e(x)","display":false},{"tex":"ep(z)=epe(x)=e(x)","display":false},{"tex":"pe=\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"ep\\leq\\operatorname{id}","display":false}],"bytes":1245,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]、[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]、[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]、[[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-thm-ep-properties]]、[[16-thm-ep-bilimit]]、[[16-thm-inverse-limit]]、[[16-df-lambda-category]]、[[16-thm-domain-model]]。极限构造的完整证明是明示的本地补写；λ-category 按 §2.5 的指定反身对象接口定义。"}],"outgoing":["ef7dfd09239bb0b1"]}